+# Public Site Architecture
+
+## What's Up in Vermont
+
+- Separate Netlify application.
+- Managed outside this GitHub repository task.
+
+## pulse-vermont-vt
+
+- Future publish directory: `sites/pulse-vt`.
+
+## pulse-core-os
+
+- Future publish directory: `sites/pulse-os`.
+
+## Google Apps Script
+
+- Driver console.
+- Reservation request app.
+- Rider access/status workflow.
