+            <div class="status-row"><b>COCKPIT</b><p>Map, shift state, trip lifecycle, route capture, and mobile controls.</p><span>TESTING</span></div>
+            <div class="status-row"><b>LOCAL SIGNALS</b><p>Weather, events, airport movement, and driver evidence.</p><span>CONNECTING</span></div>
